window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A princess with a dark curse, and a rival prince determined to steal her heart.</b></p> <p>Visteal was born a cursed princess able to foresee the death of those around her with a touch. As the heir of a warrior kingdom, she's sent to train in weapons and magic at the new academy with her rivals. Dangerous, deadly, and ferocious could describe any of the students there, her included.</p> <p>It isn't long before Visteal foresees the death of a student and realizes bloodthirsty creatures roam in the academy's stone walls. Visteal becomes a target and teaming up with an old enemy, the arrogant Prince Zyacus may be her best bet to survive.</p> <p>Fighting on the same side turns into fighting a desire they never wanted. But death and destruction will crash down on their budding feelings if they can't stop this new enemy.</p>"; 
